/// PUBLIC DATA: Eurostat labour cost index and job vacancy rate (ICT, NACE J), ICT specialists share; Statistics Lithuania average earnings.
table Market
	lineageTag: 9f640ec8-22ea-5232-8576-4bcd2b383a54

	column Quarter
